   "design": "Following the procedure to get copyrights for the completed work stays with the writer. A job checks the application in {GOV_PORTAL} for blank fields and does not fill them. The writer completes and signs it. A job files that version. A stored text with a machine-readable opt-out is not mined. The job does not own the right.",
